      "comment": "Triage: Solution 1 step 1 — navigation path to the app's Settings page. Arg 1 = app display name. The path uses iOS 18+ Settings layout which has a unified 'Apps' subgroup; AI Coach is iOS 26+ only so older layouts don't apply.",
